"""Opt-in batching of proven independent, valid free separator fills.

Build boundaries on the unchanged input pavement. Only disjoint original
boundary vertex sets, locally valid fills and a fully checked combined weld
qualify. Otherwise the original sequential construction is evaluated verbatim.
Free-cap points get per-Bundle keys rather than colliding reference indices.
"""
